{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3d6580d6ba037ea5","name":"B-Wing/E2 Starfighter","source":{"id":"source:reference-3d6580d6ba037ea5","title":"B-Wing/E2 Starfighter","revision":16063,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:03Z","sha256":"3e4c5e91030f254944031bd5baf8218a9065574ba3aafdc534b4ed3415e104a7","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16063","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=B-Wing/E2%20Starfighter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3d6580d6ba037ea5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The B-Wing/E2 Starfighter is an upgraded version of the standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["B-Wing Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/B-Wing_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:e642a3ff1c5b8013"},". Boasting an elongated cockpit that allows a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," to ride behind the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"},", the B-Wing/E2 Starfighter also features a strongly reinforced hull and upgrades to nearly all ship systems. The B-Wing/E2 Starfighter is an especially dangerous opponent due to the fact that its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," need only concentrate on flying the ship, allowing the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," to focus on operation the fighter's weapons.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["With a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," aboard, a B-Wing/E2 Starfighter can unleash its weapons in deadly pairs, giving the E2 a slight advantage even in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfighting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfighting"},". Its unique design and controls however, results in characters who are not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," skill take a -2 penalty on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," checks while piloting a B-Wing/E2 Starfighter.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["B-Wing/E2s also feature exceptionally modular weapon systems, allowing them to be modified as per the needs of the mission. When swapping out one of the B-Wing/E2's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Systems"}," for another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_System"},", reduce the time taken to make the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Modification"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Modification"}," by half.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["B-Wing/E2 Starfighter Statistics (CL 12)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children